{'symbol': 'PVH', 'date': '2020-08-26 19:30:00', 'title': 'MOVADO GROUP INC SAYS CALVIN KLEIN & CO AND ITS HONG KONG UNIT ENTERED TRADEMARK LICENSE AGREEMENT', 'text': "MOVADO GROUP INC - CALVIN KLEIN & CO AND ITS HONG KONG UNIT ENTERED TRADEMARK LICENSE AGREEMENT DATED AS OF AUGUST 19, 2020.MOVADO GROUP INC -  CALVIN KLEIN GRANTS CO WORLDWIDE RIGHT AND LICENSE TO USE TRADEMARKS CALVIN KLEIN AND CK/CALVIN KLEIN.MOVADO GROUP INC - WORLDWIDE RIGHT AND LICENSE IS RELATED TO DEVELOPMENT, MANUFACTURE, SALE OF WATCHES AND JEWELRY COMMENCING JAN. 1, 2022.MOVADO GROUP INC - TERM OF AGREEMENT CONTINUES UNTIL DECEMBER 31, 2026.MOVADO GROUP INC - REQUIRED TO MAKE QTRLY ROYALTY PAYMENTS BEGINNING IN Q1 OF CALENDAR 2022 BASED ON A SPECIFIED PERCENTAGE OF PRODUCT NET SALES.MOVADO GROUP INC - MUST OBTAIN CALVIN KLEIN'S APPROVAL OF PRODUCT DESIGNS, PACKAGING AND RELATED MATERIAL."}